Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Unexpected Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay taught Sparky many power-forward techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and their bond grew closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky realized that Lion Jay didn’t want to be an idol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and encouraged Lion Jay to be brave and be himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but Lion Jay was held back by the gratitude he owed his agent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and gave in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, we have such a large audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have won over the crowd with our last few games.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why everyone is noticing us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this fan want an autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So you’re all fans of Team Lion Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe you guys don’t even have a single fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we’ll reluctantly pretend to be your fans then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Lion Jay is about to enter the court to prepare for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please head to the stands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and look forward to Lion Jay’s performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See you on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Lion Jay even greet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the game is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The stands are absolutely packed today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders are the first to take the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is the team everyone’s been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart’s fans are way louder than we imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart is treating this like home-court advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Home-court advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With their fans cheering them on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,they’re playing with the same ease as if this were their own practice facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the fans also do things that rattle our morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tip-off is just seconds away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire arena is drowning in cheers for Team Lion Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart is gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball is up, and Team Lion Heart secures the opening tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can lock me down by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Team Lion Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My body isn’t responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the crowd noise is definitely getting to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi Laina blows right past Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just like that! Drive and lay it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi Laina’s dribbling breakthrough means this ball is as good as in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lobs it up to Lion Jay for a flashy alley-oop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Two to zero! That was gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart strikes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad, I had a total lapse on defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t sweat it, we’ll get those points back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me answer back with this bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Up… I can’t get off the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay just served Sparky a savory, spicy hot-pot block!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Under Team Lion Heart’s relentless onslaught,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders are completely suffocated, unable to answer back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The score quickly balloons to 10-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids are playing way below their usual level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey, call a timeout right now! We need a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey! Say something, Blazey! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, they have to rely on themselves to tune out the crowd noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They just need to play their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s the only way we stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do these goats even know how to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s practically adults bullying children!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to get us on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky draws a foul on Lion Jay and earns a trip to the charity stripe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he sink these to give his team their first bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about a foul as long as it looks good on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Sparky! Here’s our chance to get on the board!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way that wasn’t a flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He totally flopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I did {\i1}not{\i0} flop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me buy our first bucket of the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Referee, I want to file a protest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re distracting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The referee shakes off the protest. Play continues!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay, we still have another possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to score this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, Team Lion Heart calls a timeout!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping their own fast break!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you call a timeout when we had such a clean look at the basket?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair is messed up. You need to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we had pushed the fast break just now, that ball was a guaranteed bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single bucket has to showcase you at your absolute finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Messy hair is a major issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn’t look good if the fans saw you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, don’t be nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blazey will break down the tactics for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing the hostile crowd noise and pressure out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll have to tune that out on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Play resumes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, look at the camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay is so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let the score gap widen any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,—Go Lion Jay!　—Go Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, we can’t lock him down at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got so timid and hesitant after just a few words from someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn’t how I play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay just got rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,—Good job!　—You really are my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice block!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He put Lion Jay on the floor, and you’re saying that’s clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, that’s a foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that not a whistle? Call a foul! Call it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re already down 10-0, why even bother playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home! Go home right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the ones who should!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t like what you see, go home!

Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Push the pace! Counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to enjoy the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,focus on the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and do our best at what we can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,our—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,strongest version!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven’t we always been questioned by everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,laughed at,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and counted out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,yet we’ve kept playing until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you, Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy learned that post up pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him out! Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay! Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With this possession,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m gonna make everyone open their eyes wide and see clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,our basketball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucket! Team Defenders is finally on the board!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The real game has only just begun.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
